{"s":[[null,1,[["p",["Fiber is a resource obtained by destroying ",["l","杂草","Weeds"]," or harvesting fully-grown ",["l","纤维种子","Fiber Seeds"],". Each weed has a 50% chance to drop 1 Fiber when cut with a ",["l","镰刀","Scythe"],", ",["l","斧头","Axe"],", ",["l","十字镐","Pickaxe"],", ",["l","锄头","Hoe"],", or ",["l","武器","Sword"],", or blown up by a ",["l","打造","bomb"],". The ",["l","沙漠商人","Desert Trader"]," will also exchange five ",["l","石头","stone"]," for one fiber on ",["l","周循环","Tuesdays"],". ",["l","文森特","Vincent"]," sells Fiber in his ",["l","沙漠节","shop"]," at the ",["l","沙漠节","Desert Festival"]," for 1 Calico Egg ",["l","卡利科三花蛋","Calico Egg"],"s per set of 10."]],["p",["Weeds that drop Fiber can frequently be found in high quantities on Floors 25-29 and 81-109 of ",["l","矿井","the Mines"],". The late-game ",["l","突变虫穴","Mutant Bug Lair"]," is also a good source, generating 40-70 fiber from its weeds, which regenerate every few days."]],["p",[["l","荒野石魔","Wilderness Golem"],"s and ",["l","铱石魔","Iridium Golem"],"s on the ",["l","农场地图","Wilderness Farm map"]," have a 90% chance of dropping Fiber, and a 50% chance of dropping a second Fiber, when slain."]],["p",["Fiber is always normal quality."]]]],["Stages",2,[["p",["Shown below are the stages of growth when Fiber is grown from ",["i","(O)885","Fiber Seeds"],"."]],["t",[[{"h":1,"v":["Season"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 1"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 2"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 3"]},{"h":1,"v":["Stage 4"]},{"h":1,"v":["Harvest"]}],[{"h":1,"v":["Spring\nSummer"]},[["f","Fiber_Stage_1.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_2.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_3.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_4.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_5.png",45]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Fall"]},[["f","Fiber_Stage_1_Fall.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_2_Fall.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_3_Fall.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_4_Fall.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_5_Fall.png",45]]],[{"h":1,"v":["Winter"]},[["f","Fiber_Stage_1_Winter.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_2_Winter.png",45]],[["f","Fiber_Stage_3_Wi